{"blocks": [{"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "cd097253f099c821e4a63cd5d3338e43", "text": "API安全平台-资产梳理运营支撑能力", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "emphasized_text_contents": ["API安全平台-资产梳理运营支撑能力"], "emphasized_text_tags": ["b"], "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Normal", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "fd5aae9cff506c1ce2065d011c7e47a5", "text": "场景一：专业运营人员运营环境", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 1", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "3301acaa8837f776a70a95d31aef460d", "text": "1.1 特点", "metadata": {"category_depth": 1, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 2", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "fd5aae9cff506c1ce2065d011c7e47a5"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "0f514e473f6649d3d62879a2017f2741", "text": "客户拥有充足的运营人力资源、客户给出了API台账。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "3301acaa8837f776a70a95d31aef460d"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "a6cce9430bae10459a22adf54ac32c6d", "text": "1.2 场景描述", "metadata": {"category_depth": 1, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 2", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "fd5aae9cff506c1ce2065d011c7e47a5"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "19781dc3662ffbbf277459ad956e24dd", "text": "专业运营人员已从业务系统部门（即客户研发部门）获取了应用系统清单及各应用系统所包含的API清单(台账)。这些API可能仅是整体API集合中的关键部分。基于此清单，需对流量中的API进行整理，建立电子台账，并在此基础上对这些关键API资产进行管理。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "a6cce9430bae10459a22adf54ac32c6d"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "c6c1634714ed2816e4d345497f378f62", "text": "1.3 必备能力(功能)：", "metadata": {"category_depth": 1, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 2", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "fd5aae9cff506c1ce2065d011c7e47a5"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "16099530a1f63824c87663ac416de825", "text": "1.3.1 可灵活定义API标识", "metadata": {"category_depth": 2, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 3", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "c6c1634714ed2816e4d345497f378f62"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "bae4f90d11a5567a95f6b795c9adde05", "text": "API通常由请求方法、域名和路径组成，它们将功能列表映射为网络接口，确保客户端能访问正确的服务。然而，在管理API资产时，仅依赖这些默认的三元组通常不足以满足需求，因为路径可能因框架或第三方网关而缺乏清晰的语义，影响管理。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "16099530a1f63824c87663ac416de825"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "cf73c44f9fdcea7e568fee0687070c7d", "text": "平台功能-自定义API", "metadata": {"category_depth": 3, "emphasized_text_contents": ["平台功能", "平台功能", "-自定义API", "-自定义API"], "emphasized_text_tags": ["b", "i", "b", "i"], "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 4", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "16099530a1f63824c87663ac416de825"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "36b3bc557bd9f905dec7e8f097f68704", "text": "平台允许通过自定义参数和配置，将HTTP报文中的任何信息用作URL或Host，从而实现更灵活的API标识。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "emphasized_text_contents": ["平台允许通过自定义参数和配置，将HTTP报文中的任何信息用作URL或Host，从而实现更灵活的API标识。", "平台允许通过自定义参数和配置，将HTTP报文中的任何信息用作URL或Host，从而实现更灵活的API标识。"], "emphasized_text_tags": ["b", "i"], "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "cf73c44f9fdcea7e568fee0687070c7d"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "36426325de7c0d1adeb9db8a7311779b", "text": "平台功能-业务配置", "metadata": {"category_depth": 3, "emphasized_text_contents": ["平台功能", "平台功能", "-业务配置", "-业务配置"], "emphasized_text_tags": ["b", "i", "b", "i"], "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 4", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "16099530a1f63824c87663ac416de825"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "f5340c9ff8e3f59d611e3709989e3aba", "text": "平台可以在自定义API的基础上进一步配置业务，提供业务功能的中文表达(参考场景二)。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "emphasized_text_contents": ["平台", "平台", "可以在自定义API的基础上进一步配置业务，提供业务功能的中文表达", "可以在自定义API的基础上进一步配置业务，提供业务功能的中文表达", "(", "(", "参考场景二", "参考场景二", ")", ")", "。", "。"], "emphasized_text_tags": ["b", "i", "b", "i", "b", "i", "b", "i", "b", "i", "b", "i"], "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "36426325de7c0d1adeb9db8a7311779b"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "b3fea20a93d8a73dbefd257a000982c0", "text": "场景实例1", "metadata": {"category_depth": 3, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 4", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "16099530a1f63824c87663ac416de825"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "b9e90586e6b1cc5e435aaf5c9cacda44", "text": "某银行客户的个人网银系统，用了阿里团队提供的网关服务。这个网关的接口URL是由随机字母组成的ID。网关通过一次HTTP请求中的某个特定字段来识别和映射网络接口。简单来说，平时我们用Method（方法）、Host（主机）、Url（网址）来识别API，但在这个客户的系统中，需要用Method、Host、Header中的某个字段来识别API。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "b3fea20a93d8a73dbefd257a000982c0"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "adbdbec548e66664730462b7bd66d787", "text": "场景实例2", "metadata": {"category_depth": 3, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 4", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "16099530a1f63824c87663ac416de825"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "62504781204605e7654d91fb20e069d1", "text": "某大行分行，客户业务系统中存在与场景1类似的场景，URL没有语义，仅作为了一组子业务的标识，真正的API标识存于Header中，且HTTP流量Header中的标识是一个数字类型的id，没有语言含义，需要根据客户提供的映射表设置业务。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "adbdbec548e66664730462b7bd66d787"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "3fa945597fb5da3871d93c753c1a189c", "text": "某大银行的分行，客户业务系统中有个场景和场景1很像，URL没有体现具体业务含义，只是用来标识一组子业务的标识，真正的API标识在请求头中。在此基础上HTTP请求头中的标识是一个数字ID，没有可读性，需要根据客户提供的中文业务名称映射表来设置业务。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "adbdbec548e66664730462b7bd66d787"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "498686b6008c85906aceab930887a6ff", "text": "1.3.2 对资产进行细分配置", "metadata": {"category_depth": 2, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 3", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "c6c1634714ed2816e4d345497f378f62"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "ee0692ebb3cd978f539a5d2270b2473f", "text": "1、 应用维度进行管理", "metadata": {"category_depth": 3, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 4", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "498686b6008c85906aceab930887a6ff"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "d9e80d8296e8f3a8aba0322e3f597da2", "text": "基于业务系统视角进行的API梳理：某个应用系统下的某个业务，如：“个人网银系统下的转账业务API”，符合终端用户的理解逻辑，也符合研发人员的接口组织逻辑。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "ee0692ebb3cd978f539a5d2270b2473f"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "1b0941281944eb0471280e70418b8460", "text": "平台功能-应用配置", "metadata": {"category_depth": 4, "emphasized_text_contents": ["平台", "功能-应用配置"], "emphasized_text_tags": ["b", "b"], "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 5", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "ee0692ebb3cd978f539a5d2270b2473f"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "e3f2eeb1f5e15b8e58a5182e96c9c222", "text": "依据Host与URL前缀区分应用系统，支持多域名合并配置为同一个应用。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "1b0941281944eb0471280e70418b8460"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "8858abf92b22e6828c4dcb4301ab4bd8", "text": "平台功能-业务配置", "metadata": {"category_depth": 4, "emphasized_text_contents": ["平台", "功能-业务配置"], "emphasized_text_tags": ["b", "b"], "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 5", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "ee0692ebb3cd978f539a5d2270b2473f"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "2d40538a6aadf77da400d42ba2e15ed9", "text": "依据URL区分业务，支持URL的模糊匹配。业务归属于某个应用。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "8858abf92b22e6828c4dcb4301ab4bd8"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "c5fdcf6c7717d80b40d910ae7e9e0283", "text": "2、 跨应用管理能力：运营人员对重点类型的业务API进行跨应用管理。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 3, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 4", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "498686b6008c85906aceab930887a6ff"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "959c2341b61676e78dfdd0f366c2e8d9", "text": "平台功能-分组", "metadata": {"category_depth": 4, "emphasized_text_contents": ["平台", "功能-分组"], "emphasized_text_tags": ["b", "b"], "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 5", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "c5fdcf6c7717d80b40d910ae7e9e0283"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "5b540c5090fa53b706a83a86978d3161", "text": "需要能够配置API特征自动归纳一组API。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "959c2341b61676e78dfdd0f366c2e8d9"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "74205a95e4ed06ca191d06d31506e6f5", "text": "场景实例", "metadata": {"category_depth": 5, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 6", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "959c2341b61676e78dfdd0f366c2e8d9"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "84e52cc983321820c27aa596c412960c", "text": "某银行客户，运营人员希望平台对所有携带指定鉴权字段的API进行分组展示、管理，且要求不能通过手工配置(数量多且预先不知道哪些API包含此鉴权字段)，要求平台能根据匹配规则对API进行分组。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "74205a95e4ed06ca191d06d31506e6f5"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "4468890c2cd6b6c1c701a3d4eb77129d", "text": "3、 平台功能-标签配置、资产价值配置", "metadata": {"category_depth": 3, "emphasized_text_contents": ["平台", "功能"], "emphasized_text_tags": ["b", "b"], "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 4", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "498686b6008c85906aceab930887a6ff"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "479c9c797c148d629f621aaf917c1b85", "text": "重点API管控：对于重点API的个性化管理可通过手动添加标签的方式进一步标记。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Normal", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "4468890c2cd6b6c1c701a3d4eb77129d"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "5bc1d45150fc9b54a6e206962e7a1c48", "text": "4、 平台功能-应用备注信息", "metadata": {"category_depth": 3, "emphasized_text_contents": ["平台", "功能"], "emphasized_text_tags": ["b", "b"], "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 4", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "498686b6008c85906aceab930887a6ff"}}, {"type": "ListItem", "element_id": "c28f53b5be2c5049225b0358e126b5ec", "text": "平台功能-应用备注配置、信息展示：在对应用进行梳理时，可以配置负责人员的信息，在发现风险与异常时可以直观看到备注信息。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "5bc1d45150fc9b54a6e206962e7a1c48"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "c7a64af48c175acb4588219bcd670ba3", "text": "场景二：缺乏运营人力资源，无台账", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 1", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "03fc08904ead6cfcac39fbdb02b74841", "text": "2.1特点", "metadata": {"category_depth": 1, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 2", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "c7a64af48c175acb4588219bcd670ba3"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "0e2b07c82420160c82177c883b1475ec", "text": "客户无法安排充足的运营人力资源，且没有API台账，运营人员对流量中的业务系统不熟悉。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "03fc08904ead6cfcac39fbdb02b74841"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "6f7fe7e24fcb72bbcf6da49f1bf3d7bc", "text": "2.2场景描述", "metadata": {"category_depth": 1, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 2", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "c7a64af48c175acb4588219bcd670ba3"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "2c4a0c793c67e7e43617d762b453c2d4", "text": "客户运营人员无法投入较多时间运营平台，仅对流量中的核心应用系统与API有了解，希望平台高效的帮助他们梳理流量中的应用与API。这种场景下主要依赖于平台的自动化能力。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "6f7fe7e24fcb72bbcf6da49f1bf3d7bc"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "fd28fe4714e7a86a3ef594039a00ba23", "text": "2.3必备能力(功能)：", "metadata": {"category_depth": 1, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 2", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "c7a64af48c175acb4588219bcd670ba3"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "b8e2d7c593a5a2eb1b2212e46592c388", "text": "2.3.1开箱即用的API归类能力", "metadata": {"category_depth": 2, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 3", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "fd28fe4714e7a86a3ef594039a00ba23"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "499908e26166bf18becf2c0154feba6a", "text": "平台功能-API自动合并", "metadata": {"category_depth": 3, "emphasized_text_contents": ["平台", "功能-API自动合并"], "emphasized_text_tags": ["b", "b"], "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 4", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "b8e2d7c593a5a2eb1b2212e46592c388"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "8a4b435eb47ba61bcbc6abb5ba046ca9", "text": "在Web API中常常会使用到路径参数，这类API的请求URL由于路径参数的不同而不同，如果单纯的使用Method、Host、URL作为API标识，会导致逻辑上的同一个API（后端系统的接口也是同一个），被展示为多个API。此时需要平台对这类API进行精准识别，识别时不仅依据URL这个字符串的接口与相似度进行判断，还必须结合多个相似API的请求数据包的内容结构相似度。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "emphasized_text_contents": ["识别时不仅依据URL这个字符串的接口与相似度进行判断，还必须结合多个相似API的请求数据包的内容结构相似度。"], "emphasized_text_tags": ["b"], "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "499908e26166bf18becf2c0154feba6a"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "e4b6e5878ed05df1dc3117e3405a79e6", "text": "平台功能-API智能标签", "metadata": {"category_depth": 3, "emphasized_text_contents": ["平台", "功能-API智能标签"], "emphasized_text_tags": ["b", "b"], "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 4", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "b8e2d7c593a5a2eb1b2212e46592c388"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "079bccc60f80258969c8062edf9fd580", "text": "在系统较多，客户时间较为紧张的环境中，平台自主梳理的能力体现点之一就是为API赋予一个可读的业务标签，让客户快速熟悉应用下的常见业务系统，进而快速理解应用的整体对外服务业务。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "e4b6e5878ed05df1dc3117e3405a79e6"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "46d3e4da16f9277c0a12c6603b9a0e26", "text": "平台功能-API活跃度、运行状态", "metadata": {"category_depth": 3, "emphasized_text_contents": ["平台", "功能-API活跃度、运行状态"], "emphasized_text_tags": ["b", "b"], "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 4", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "b8e2d7c593a5a2eb1b2212e46592c388"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "9782ceb02030e5d7eb5e7d791ea29943", "text": "基于全流量分析与留存，平台可以得到每个API的当日访问情况与历史累计访问状态。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "46d3e4da16f9277c0a12c6603b9a0e26"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "9bab9d29d158b8adf79a25ea243e2b5c", "text": "2.3.2 AI能力", "metadata": {"category_depth": 2, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 3", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "fd28fe4714e7a86a3ef594039a00ba23"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "8d2287965ca36c8384ab53215cde7503", "text": "平台功能-AI助手", "metadata": {"category_depth": 4, "emphasized_text_contents": ["平台", "平台", "功能-AI助手", "功能-AI助手"], "emphasized_text_tags": ["b", "i", "b", "i"], "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 5", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "9bab9d29d158b8adf79a25ea243e2b5c"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "4a2de8420bffcad9c0816d44ba400e8b", "text": "在人力紧张时，平台基于上述功能可以实现较高的自动化梳理，无人细致配置的情况下已经初具可读性，此时API的智能识别还停留在常见业务类型阶段。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "8d2287965ca36c8384ab53215cde7503"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "5ea570c636da61bf03631fde5515dd4d", "text": "AI助手能够主动利用平台整理好的数据，并结合API的原始流量报文，为API提供更为精准的业务类型分类以及更加清晰的业务功能分析。模仿人工，阅读平台解析、梳理后的API数据，不间断进行业务与应用的配置。在此情境中，AI助手的作用极为关键，它能够使客户以较低的时间成本迅速掌握流量中各个系统的业务功能及敏感性等级。同时，它可以促使平台各项梳理功能自主运作，充分发挥平台的梳理能力。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "emphasized_text_contents": ["AI助手", "AI助手", "能够主动利用平台整理好的数据，并结合API的原始流量报文，为API提供更为精", "能够主动利用平台整理好的数据，并结合API的原始流量报文，为API提供更为精", "准", "准", "的业务类型分类以及更加清晰的业务功能", "的业务类型分类以及更加清晰的业务功能", "分析", "分析", "。", "。", "模仿人工，阅读平台解析、梳理后的API数据，不间断进行业务与应用的配置", "模仿人工，阅读平台解析、梳理后的API数据，不间断进行业务与应用的配置", "。", "。", "在此情境中，AI助手的作用极为关键，它能够使客户以较低的时间成本迅速掌握流量中各个系统的业务功能及敏感性等级。同时，它可以促使平台各项梳理功能自主运作，充分发挥平台的梳理能力。", "在此情境中，AI助手的作用极为关键，它能够使客户以较低的时间成本迅速掌握流量中各个系统的业务功能及敏感性等级。同时，它可以促使平台各项梳理功能自主运作，充分发挥平台的梳理能力。"], "emphasized_text_tags": ["b", "i", "b", "i", "b", "i", "b", "i", "b", "i", "b", "i", "b", "i", "b", "i", "b", "i"], "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "8d2287965ca36c8384ab53215cde7503"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "789fd757b826785c1c57600000176def", "text": "下图展示了平台AI助手在API整理功能中的操作流程。AI助手利用平台自动整理的API数据以及API的原始请求数据，对API的业务功能、敏感等级和适用的防护策略进行深入分析。分析完成后，它将自主运用场景一中所述的平台配置功能进行配置，生成一系列API业务配置结果。在此基础上，AI助手还将根据同一应用或同一域名下的其他API数据，对应用进行补充配置，或为已配置的应用添加应用功能分析。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "8d2287965ca36c8384ab53215cde7503"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "00e676b724c3dd309eaa421ac10df30c", "text": "平台基础设施", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 1", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "205eca435dec9f76530595b4cce9109c", "text": "平台能力-全流量留存", "metadata": {"category_depth": 1, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 2", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "00e676b724c3dd309eaa421ac10df30c"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "4d8ead8dd87a2d780310fe108f7c7664", "text": "实际上，在任何场景中，此能力均为不可或缺。全面流量留存首先确保了API列表的完整性，随后，通过完整的流量，能够获取到各个应用、各个API的全面运行状况，从而协助客户理解业务系统的运行状况。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "205eca435dec9f76530595b4cce9109c"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "a09cdf8c0b134ef72e835b9c871c09db", "text": "特别是在平台自动整理的API列表与客户台账存在差异的情况下，全面流量记录能够提供原始HTTP流量的全部报文，借此帮助客户发现差异原因（比如台账标识不是常规的URL而是Header中某字段），进而添加符合客户要求的API标识位置，这将极大地提升排查效率并增强说服力。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "emphasized_text_contents": ["特别是在平台自动整理的API列表与客户台账存在差异的情况下，全面流量记录能够提供原始HTTP流量的全部报文，借此帮助客户发现差异原因（比如台账标识不是常规的URL而是Header中某字段），进而添加符合客户要求的API标识位置，这将极大地提升排查效率并增强说服力。", "特别是在平台自动整理的API列表与客户台账存在差异的情况下，全面流量记录能够提供原始HTTP流量的全部报文，借此帮助客户发现差异原因（比如台账标识不是常规的URL而是Header中某字段），进而添加符合客户要求的API标识位置，这将极大地提升排查效率并增强说服力。"], "emphasized_text_tags": ["b", "i"], "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "205eca435dec9f76530595b4cce9109c"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "8f87b4e23dae9bdbe1a0456404ae1495", "text": "平台能力-大数据处理能力", "metadata": {"category_depth": 1, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 2", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "00e676b724c3dd309eaa421ac10df30c"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "d148bbbb419def522a693e978ceae6f5", "text": "全流量留存与大数据处理能力紧密相连，缺一不可。否则，系统仅能实现数据存储，而无法进行有效查询，进而无法为平台各项功能提供支撑。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "8f87b4e23dae9bdbe1a0456404ae1495"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "ddf4cbe954ad3944e78d07f3b47595d6", "text": "平台能力-离线溯源", "metadata": {"category_depth": 1, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Heading 2", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "00e676b724c3dd309eaa421ac10df30c"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "02060f9a0c588c91d4a0059e4ffa3418", "text": "作为大数据处理能力的辅助功能，当客户需在海量数据中寻找具有特定特征的流量时，离线溯源功能确保查询过程不被中断，并且无需客户在页面前进行等待。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "acef55897693be5e6ee0a35528374b77e50b8ca5626fc827b1f163fd0614eeaf.docx", "last_modified": "2024-12-30T16:55:26", "style_name": "Body Text", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "ddf4cbe954ad3944e78d07f3b47595d6"}}]}